    <p class="cwm-mono">03 — Origin</p>
    <h2>Civic, then MCCS,<br />then a plant.</h2>
    <p>
      After a job loss, the founder detailed out of an old Honda Civic. Equipment and client lists
      from closed shops led to Marine Corps Community Services — repairing a failing wash, then
      winning FAR-compliant contracts on installations, including Marine Corps Base Hawaii.
    </p>
    <p>
      That field history is the brand: operators, not a boardroom.
    </p>
